.el .ds Aq '
.TH batten-forge-intake 1  batten 
.SH NAME
batten\-forge\-intake \- Run one forge event payload from stdin through the handlers and rules a harness hook gets
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbatten forge intake\fR [\fB\-\-event\fR] [\fB\-\-from\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Run one forge event payload from stdin through the handlers and rules a harness hook gets
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-event\fR \fI<event>\fR
The X\-GitHub\-Event name the webhook body on stdin arrived under
.TP
\fB\-\-from\fR \fI<from>\fR
`wake`: stdin is a harness user\-prompt\-submit payload carrying the event
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
